    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d571">

                <pb facs="0555" n="479" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg479"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 125.36582/123</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Carothers
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 12, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>You will travel with Villa until we can find someone to take your place, a
                    difficult task, owing to the limited number of persons possessing the requisite
                    qualifications, namely, loyalty to the administration, having the friendship of
                    Villa and a knowledge of the Spanish language. Keep us fully informed as to
                    progress of events.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
